msgstr "c.ii. Nastavení `QuantumProgram` {#cii-set-up-the-quantumprogram}"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"c.iii. Execute program with the `Executor` primitive {#ciii-execute-program-"
